---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="研讨" description="慧灯净土 · AI 考问与圆桌">
  <article class="page-hero yt-page">
    <div class="wrap yt-hero">
      <p class="group-label" style="margin-top: 0;">慧灯净土</p>
      <h1>研讨</h1>
      <p>以本站文稿与净土义理为依，辅助考问与圆桌闻思。不能替代老实念佛与如理实修。</p>

      <div class="yt-cards">
        <a class="yt-card" href="/yantao/exam/">
          <p class="yt-kicker">Exam</p>
          <h2>堪布考问</h2>
          <p>选择已学课次，由严肃堪布依原文出题、点评并研讨。</p>
        </a>
        <a class="yt-card" href="/yantao/seminar/">
          <p class="yt-kicker">Seminar</p>
          <h2>佛学圆桌</h2>
          <p>就一议题邀请佛学代表人物对谈。内容源于网络与模型生成，仅供参考，不作学修依据。</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

